L["Anger Management is a steady rage trickle in every fight; on Forever it also slows rage loss between pulls."] = "Anger Management je stálý přísun rage v každém boji; na Forever navíc zpomaluje ztrátu rage mezi pully."
L["Another addon is hiding the guide window or the arrow. The chat says how to get it back."] = "Jiný addon skrývá okno návodu nebo šipku. V chatu je, jak je vrátit."
L["Another addon is keeping the arrow out of sight. Some UI addons lead the way with their own arrow or route instead: turn that off in that addon to get it back."] = "Jiný addon drží šipku mimo dohled. Některé UI addony místo ní vedou vlastní šipkou nebo trasou: vypni to v tom addonu, aby se vrátila."
L["Another addon is keeping the guide window and the arrow out of sight. Some UI addons show the guide's steps in their own quest tracker and route instead: turn that off in that addon to get Evertally's back."] = "Jiný addon drží okno návodu a šipku mimo dohled. Některé UI addony ukazují kroky návodu ve vlastním quest trackeru a trase: vypni to v tom addonu, aby se Evertally vrátilo."
L["Another addon is keeping the guide window out of sight. Some UI addons show the guide's steps in their own quest tracker instead: turn that off in that addon to get it back."] = "Jiný addon drží okno návodu mimo dohled. Některé UI addony ukazují kroky návodu ve vlastním quest trackeru: vypni to v tom addonu, aby se vrátilo."
