L["Hides the game's tracker on the right of the screen, with its quests, achievements and professions, as Questie can. Not with the gamepad interface."] = "Skryje herní tracker vpravo na obrazovce s questy, achievementy a profesemi, jako to umí Questie. Ne s rozhraním pro gamepad."
